Hold all questions till the end, please.

57
00:07:44,421 --> 00:07:45,482
Sorry.

58
00:07:45,506 --> 00:07:48,443
The colonies offer an alternative,
a better way of life.

59
00:07:48,467 --> 00:07:49,694
Where are all the other...

60
00:07:49,718 --> 00:07:53,823
<i>And there's no colony
more beautiful than homestead ii,</i>

61
00:07:53,847 --> 00:07:55,825
the Jewel of the occupied world.

62
00:07:55,849 --> 00:07:57,243
I'm sorry.

63
00:07:57,267 --> 00:07:58,477
Where is everybody?

64
00:07:58,978 --> 00:08:01,039
We are all on the starship avalon.

65
00:08:01,063 --> 00:08:02,499
But I'm the only one here.

66
00:08:02,523 --> 00:08:06,652
There are 5,000 passengers
and 258 crew members.

67
00:08:07,194 --> 00:08:08,404
So why am I alone?

68
00:08:08,904 --> 00:08:10,739
We're all in this together.

69
00:08:12,908 --> 00:08:13,909
Hello?

70
00:08:15,869 --> 00:08:17,204
Anybody here?

71
00:08:17,705 --> 00:08:19,039
Hello?

72
00:08:30,092 --> 00:08:33,113
Please buckle up and secure any loose items.

73
00:08:33,137 --> 00:08:36,849
This elevator will experience
a momentary lapse in gravity.

74
00:08:59,872 --> 00:09:01,749
Grand concourse.

75
00:09:14,845 --> 00:09:15,846
Hello.

76
00:09:16,805 --> 00:09:19,075
Welcome to the grand concourse
aboard the avalon.

77
00:09:19,099 --> 00:09:20,267
Can I help you?

78
00:09:21,143 --> 00:09:23,121
I need to talk to a person.

79
00:09:23,145 --> 00:09:24,873
A real live person, please?

80
00:09:24,897 --> 00:09:27,066
What sort of person?
Personal trainer? Travel planner?

81
00:09:27,191 --> 00:09:28,835
- Therapist?
- I don't know.

82
00:09:28,859 --> 00:09:30,295
Somebody in charge.

83
00:09:30,319 --> 00:09:32,172
The ship's steward
handles passenger affairs.

84
00:09:32,196 --> 00:09:34,382
It's on level three of the grand concourse.

85
00:09:34,406 --> 00:09:36,075
- Thank you.
- Happy to help.

86
00:09:41,789 --> 00:09:42,790
Not good.

87
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:44,809
- Hello.
- Who's flying the ship?

88
00:09:44,833 --> 00:09:46,811
The flight crew, the captain, the pilot,
the chief navigator...

89
00:09:46,835 --> 00:09:48,980
Captain. I want to speak to the captain.

90
00:09:49,004 --> 00:09:50,899
The captain rarely handles
passenger queries...

91
00:09:50,923 --> 00:09:52,674
It's an emergency! Please.

92
00:09:53,175 --> 00:09:56,428
The captain is usually found on the bridge,
in the command ring.

93
00:10:06,855 --> 00:10:09,858
Bridge access requires special authorization.

94
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:14,696
Bridge access requires special authorization.

95
00:10:17,699 --> 00:10:19,952
