Welcome to the observatory.

97
00:10:37,553 --> 00:10:40,055
What can I show you?

98
00:10:40,264 --> 00:10:42,224
We're supposed to land soon.

99
00:10:45,060 --> 00:10:47,896
I'm the only one awake.

100
00:10:48,063 --> 00:10:50,566
