I want the mocha cappuccino extreme.

183
00:15:10,033 --> 00:15:11,135
Bill my room, please.

184
00:15:11,159 --> 00:15:12,762
Food can be purchased in the ship's...

185
00:15:12,786 --> 00:15:14,347
Sorry. The French roast...

186
