Large coffee.

190
00:15:22,045 --> 00:15:24,005
- Cream...
- Please enjoy your coffee.

191
00:15:24,506 --> 00:15:25,507
Really?

192
00:16:46,838 --> 00:16:50,509
Crew pod room access
requires special authorization.

193
00:17:34,302 --> 00:17:36,680
Grand... Going...

194
00:17:37,055 --> 00:17:39,266
Please make... level...

195
00:17:40,517 --> 00:17:42,245
Grand concourse.

196
00:17:42,269 --> 00:17:43,395
I'm screwed, Arthur.

197
00:17:44,229 --> 00:17:46,123
Completely and ridiculously screwed.

198
00:17:46,147 --> 00:17:47,542
Come on, now.

199
00:17:47,566 --> 00:17:49,609
Every cloud has a silver lining.

200
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:54,715
Guess I am gonna die of old age on this ship.

201
00:17:54,739 --> 00:17:56,199
We all die.

202
00:17:56,908 --> 00:17:58,660
Even androids end up on the scrap heap.

203
00:17:59,911 --> 00:18:02,330
I'm your only customer.
Why are you always polishing a glass?

204
00:18:03,456 --> 00:18:04,976
Trick of the trade.

205
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,687
Makes people nervous
when a bartender just stands there.

206
00:18:07,711 --> 00:18:09,355
So lay some bartender wisdom on me.

207
00:18:09,379 --> 00:18:11,172
I'm lost in space here.

208
00:18:13,425 --> 00:18:16,028
You're not where you want to be.

209
00:18:16,052 --> 00:18:18,555
You feel like you're supposed
to be somewhere else.

210
00:18:23,018 --> 00:18:24,060
You said it.

211
00:18:24,185 --> 00:18:25,997
Well, say you could snap your fingers

212
00:18:26,021 --> 00:18:28,499
and be wherever you wanted to be.

213
00:18:28,523 --> 00:18:30,275
I bet you'd still feel this way.

214
00:18:30,567 --> 00:18:32,128
Not in the right place.

215
00:18:32,152 --> 00:18:36,007
Point is, you can't get so hung up
on where you'd rather be

216
00:18:36,031 --> 00:18:38,283
that you forget how to make
the most of where you are.

217
00:18:38,867 --> 00:18:40,469
What are you telling me?

218
00:18:40,493 --> 00:18:43,538
Take a break from worrying
about what you can't control.

219
00:18:45,332 --> 00:18:46,374
Live a little.

220
00:18:47,375 --> 00:18:49,169
Live a little.

221
00:18:58,219 --> 00:19:00,805
Welcome to the Vienna suite.

222
00:19:02,098 --> 00:19:03,558
Yeah.

223
00:19:08,396 --> 00:19:09,856
What?

224
00:19:17,238 --> 00:19:19,467
- Yeah! Yeah!
- Yeah!

225
00:19:19,491 --> 00:19:21,052
Make that a double jumbo shrimp.

226
00:19:21,076 --> 00:19:22,202
Triple.

227
00:19:24,746 --> 00:19:25,747
Dance-off.

228
00:19:28,083 --> 00:19:29,501
All right.

229
00:19:31,544 --> 00:19:32,754
