But please listen.

757
01:05:53,574 --> 01:05:57,536
I was so alone for so long.

758
01:05:59,037 --> 01:06:00,289
It felt like I was disappearing.

759
01:06:02,124 --> 01:06:05,127
The night I first saw you, I was ready to...

760
